  "about": "Bandage by part (docs/gameplay/medical_actions_by_part_v1.md): the chest (6 s, MedicalItem.BANDAGE_TORSO_TICKS 120), standing or sat (upper body). The pad pressed on under the right hand; three turns round the chest under the armpits from 0.9 s, 1.4 s each: the right hand takes the roll round the right side to the back, the left takes it there (the roll a little lower behind) and brings it round the left side to the front while the right presses the front. The end laid on (5.1 s), torn off (5.3 s), patted twice, hands down from 5.65 s; the head looks down at it. The roll (player_props/bandage) keyed every 0.05 s on a rounded path 1.6 px off the part; both arms solved by IK on it and baked into the clip as FK (hold_body). Written by tools/medical-actions-v1a/author_dress_v1.cjs.",
